  "slug": "smart-hawker",
  "audio_url": "/audio/russian/2677_smart-hawker.mp3",
  "english_paragraphs": [
    "A man went to buy some milk. The vendor said, “Three yuan a cup, or ten yuan for three cups.”",
    "The man paid three yuan for a cup and did the same thing two more times. Then he said to the vendor, “See? I got three cups for just nine yuan.”",
    "The vendor said, “When I price it this way, I sell three cups every time.”"
  ],
  "english_full": "A man went to buy some milk. The vendor said, “Three yuan a cup, or ten yuan for three cups.”\n\nThe man paid three yuan for a cup and did the same thing two more times. Then he said to the vendor, “See? I got three cups for just nine yuan.”\n\nThe vendor said, “When I price it this way, I sell three cups every time.”",
  "russian_paragraphs": [
    "Дя́дя пошёл покупа́ть молоко́. Прода́вець ска́зал: «Три юа́ня за ча́шку, или деся́ть юа́н за три ча́шки.»",
    "Дя́дя заплати́л три юа́ня за ча́шку и сде́лал то́же са́мое ещё два ра́за. Тогда́ он ска́зал прода́вцу: «Ви́дишь? Я купи́л три ча́шки всего́ за девя́ть юа́ней.»",
    "Прода́вець ска́зал: «Когда́ я устанавли́ваю цену́ так, я продаю́ три ча́шки всегда́.»"
  ],
  "reading_paragraphs": [
    "Dyádya poshyól pokupát' molokó. Prodávets' skázal: «Tri yuánya za cháshku, ili desyát' yuán za tri cháshki.»",
    "Dyádya zaplatíl tri yuánya za cháshku i sdélal tózhe sámoye yeshchyo dva ráza. Toghdá on skázal prodávtsu: «Vídish? Ya kupíl tri cháshki vsegó za devyát' yuáney.»",
    "Prodávets' skázal: «Kogdá ya ustanavliváyu tsenú tak, ya prodayú tri cháshki vsegdá.»"
  ],
